&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;"&gt;a  繰越欠損金は、法定実効税率を乗じた額であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:40.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;当連結会計年度（自　&lt;span&gt;2023年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;  至　&lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
